From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikita Sokolsky <sokolx@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:45:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] path-60: frame-time fixes and their switches

Shuffle-free tensor multiply for the upscaling network, CPU widening of 8-bit indices, list-indirect draws, the
bilinear stand-in upscaler (P60_OOT_BILINEAR), the frame trace (p60_trace.h) and the other P60_* switches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
